      <dia:attribute name="text">
        <dia:composite type="text">
          <dia:attribute name="string">
            <dia:string>#Design notes
Room stores room IDs and item IDs, not full objects.
ShipMap owns room creation and room connections.
ItemCatalog owns Items -&gt; Item definitions and actions.
Inventory stores Set&lt;Items&gt;, not Set&lt;Item&gt;.
EntityManager owns entity positions and Malien encounters.
GameRandom is the only random source.
GameGenerator creates a reproducible GameState from a seed.
Propulsors are not a Room; repairing them is a GameState action.#</dia:string>
